{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-12-20 10:34:00', 'title': 'GEORGIA NATURAL GAS FOUNDATION AWARDS $370,000 TO ATLANTA NONPROFITS', 'text': "FOUNDATION PROVIDES GRANTS TO NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS SUPPORTING CHILDREN AND EDUCATION IN METRO ATLANTA ATLANTA , DEC. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE GEORGIA NATURAL GAS FOUNDATION TODAY ANNOUNCED DONATIONS TO EIGHT OF ITS COMMUNITY PARTNERS –ARTHUR M. BLANK FAMILY YOUTH YMCA, CHILDREN'S MUSEUM OF ATLANTA, FULTON LEADERSHIP ACADEMY, COMMUNITIES IN SCHOOLS, BREAKTHROUGH ATLANTA, BIG BROTHERS BIG SISTERS, CHRIS 180 AND INROADS – THAT ARE MAKING A DIFFERENCE IN THE LIVES OF CHILDREN AND YOUNG PEOPLE."}